This tree follows the public AOSP/LineageOS device configuration interfaces.
`audio/firmware/stage1.txt` and `stage2.txt` are small tuning tables
extracted from the Meizu Flyme 8.0.5.0A production base; see
`audio/firmware/README.md`. No proprietary binaries are stored in this
repository.
